@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Validation";
}

<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2">Validation</h1>
<p class="text-text-secondary mb-8">Form correctness and rule enforcement</p>

<section class="mb-10">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    <span class="w-1 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Rule Types</h2>
</div>
<native-grid cols="C3" gap="Base">
    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="Validation" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                All Rules
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Interactive form with every rule type: required, min/max length, range, regex, comparison (equalTo, greaterThan) — submit to see errors, fix fields to see live-clear
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="ValidationContract" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Contract
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Full resident admission form: validator rules run in the browser, server-side error merge on submit, conditional field visibility tied to validation
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="RespiteBooking" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Respite Booking
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Optional values on native inputs: a blank community or daily rate is asked for, a blank length of stay is booked as open-ended and needs a plan for how it ends, a planned stay needs its last-day pickup, and a community without a transport desk needs the transport answer
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="EmergencyContacts" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Emergency Contacts
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Collection item rules under a condition on the parent: each contact's phone is required only when the resident has emergency contacts; Save Contacts checks only the contacts, and the server refuses the front desk's number beside the contact that gave it
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="FallRiskScreening" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Fall Risk Screening
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            A required yes/no question: "No" is an answer and saves, an unanswered question is asked for, an attestation checkbox must still be ticked, and the fall count, injury and neuro-check time agree with the answers
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="RoomRate" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Room Rates
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Required means what the server means: a room name of only spaces is asked for, a blank or $0 monthly rate is no rate, and a $0 community fee is a waived fee; the community's rate cap comes from its policy, the fee stays below the rate, and a suite needs its square footage
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="RoomHold" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Room Holds
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            A refusal that belongs to no field on the form, a room another family already holds, is shown in the page's validation summary; the family's agreement is asked for, and the reservations office's own rules run on the server only
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="IntakeSteps" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Resident Intake in Steps
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            One form whose steps load as partials: each step checks only the fields it shows, and a step that leaves takes its rules with it; the mobility questions arrive with the care level, and the nurse review checks care needs only once they are on the page
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="MoveInReview" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Move-in Review
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            One validator for page and server: When and Otherwise, Unless, the grammar's own messages, and rules only the server runs
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="DateValidation" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Date Rules
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            A resident's stay: admission and discharge, and the care plan review, follow-up visit and move-out inspection booked inside it, each checked against a fixed date or the stay's own dates
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="NewRuleTypes" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Specialized Rules
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Specialized input validation: email format, phone pattern, credit card (Luhn), URL format — type invalid values to see immediate feedback
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="AdmissionAssessmentRules" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Admission Assessment
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Every rule kind on native inputs, each at its boundary: text lengths, email, web address, equal and not equal, comparisons and ranges on numbers and dates, a care level, a residency and a yes/no answer. Save checks the page first; Print for the chart sends the assessment as it is and the server answers in the same words
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="DischargePlanning" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Discharge Planning
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Every form a condition can take, each gating one rule: a yes/no read as it is and negated, both and either of two answers, a blank or given number, text empty, given, containing, starting or ending with something, a choice equal to, among or anything but a value, a list holding an item, a condition inside a condition, Unless with Otherwise, and a condition after a rule's checks
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="MedicationReconciliation" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Medication Reconciliation
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Rules on each line of a list: a line's own checks, rules included on a controlled line only, a nested prescriber inside each line, a check on each allergy line itself, and at least one administration check ticked. Print the MAR sends the list as it is
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="RoomTransfer" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Room Transfer
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            What stays on the server, and how its answer reaches the page: a C# check of the room book, a lookup that waits, a message written from the model, a rule kept server-only on purpose, a condition only C# decides; two messages joined beside one field, a message in the summary, two requests checking one form, and a desk that answers in plain text and places nothing
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="OutingCompanion" asp-action="Index"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Outing Companion
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            A companion is a partial loaded into a slot of the outing form: its rules arrive with it, check the form while it is on the page, and leave with it when it is removed
        </p>
    </a>
</native-grid>
</section>

<section class="mb-10">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    <span class="w-1 h-6 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Nested &amp; Conditional</h2>
</div>
<native-grid cols="C3" gap="Base">
    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="NestedBugs" asp-action="NestedCondition"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Nested Condition
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Nested model validation with SetValidator — address fields under a parent model with conditional visibility
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="NestedBugs" asp-action="ParentChild"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Parent Child
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Parent-child form with nested property validation — tests field correlation across model hierarchies
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="NestedBugs" asp-action="IncludeConditional"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Include Conditional
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Conditional Include — gather specific fields based on condition state, not the entire form
        </p>
    </a>

    <a asp-area="Sandbox" asp-controller="NestedBugs" asp-action="OperatorConditions"
       class="group relative block rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-black/[0.03] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
        <native-hstack justify="Between" align="Start">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-text-primary group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                Operator Conditions
            </h3>
            <span class="text-text-muted group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-sm">&rarr;</span>
        </native-hstack>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Validation rules that activate based on condition operators — a When(x => ...) block toggles rule enforcement dynamically
        </p>
    </a>
</native-grid>
</section>
